build and grow my confidence.

00:01:08.950 --> 00:01:09.783
Damn.

00:01:12.190 --> 00:01:13.173
Johnston Room.

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:19.490
I spent a lot of my
teenage years in this room.

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:22.530
Just to have somewhere like
here so close to my house

00:01:22.530 --> 00:01:25.470
I didn't take that for
granted, I was here every day

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:27.300
