I just felt really good.

00:03:21.490 --> 00:03:23.450
Yeah, and then I came back.

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:26.890
It was 2015, I think I was, like, 20, 21?

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:29.199
And I had my

00:03:29.199 --> 00:03:31.340
had my own headline show here.

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:34.040
So it was like from being 9

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:36.150
and then being 15

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:38.423
