00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:01.190
If you see us at a show, you would know.

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:02.023
- Yeah.

00:05:02.023 --> 00:05:03.060
- You would know.

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:05.085
